## Task #27 / #19 unlock proof: existing C-allocated Duration with
## new pure-Riven accessors reading self.nanos directly via layout c.
##
## The C side (riven_duration_from_nanos) malloc's a
## RivenDuration { int64_t nanos } and returns the pointer. The
## Riven-side Duration class now declares `layout c; nanos: Int`
## matching the C wire layout, so self.nanos reads the same bytes
## the previous riven_duration_as_nanos C accessor read.
##
## Verifies the layout c → pure-Riven accessor port end-to-end.

use std.time.Duration

def main
  let d = Duration.from_nanos(1500000000)
  puts "#{d.as_nanos}"     # 1500000000 (Riven: self.nanos)
  puts "#{d.as_micros}"    # 1500000 (Riven: self.nanos / 1000)
  puts "#{d.as_millis}"    # 1500 (Riven: self.nanos / 1_000_000)
  puts "#{d.as_secs}"      # 1 (Riven: self.nanos / 1_000_000_000)
end
